    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      369.66,
      286.41,
      447.92
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment) that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a for public purpose:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613,
      16.078292846679688
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      448.64,
      286.47,
      539.35
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land in total extent of about 0.0115 Hectare depicted as Lot No. 137 in Block No. 1 of 9 in Cadastral Map No. 510811 dated 24.11.2016 prepared by the Survey General situated in the village called Kendaliyaddapaluwa East in Adhikari Pattuwa Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Mahara in Gampaha District of the Western province and more fully described as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      552.32,
      286.43,
      615.2
    ],
    "text": "SCHEDULE Lot No. 137 Name of the Land: Pepolgahawatta; Description: Home Garden; Claimant: Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.0115 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.28,
      539.45,
      444.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Mahara Divisional Secretariat on the 24th day of October 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 17th day of October 2017 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      318.0,
      447.4,
      519.72,
      564.32
    ],
